/* ---------- policies (Our studios & policies page) ---------- */
const POLICIES = [
  { title: 'Check-in / Check-out policy', html: '<ul><li>Check-in on weekdays: 15:00 – 19:00</li><li>Check-in on weekends: 15:00 – 19:00</li><li>Late Check-In (after opening times) is possible, and for that you will receive Self Check In instructions, after the accommodation is paid.</li><li>Check-out: until 10:00</li></ul><p>See <a href="faq.html">FAQ</a> for more infos.</p>' },
  { title: 'Credit cards', html: '<p>We accept all major credit and debit cards, including Visa, Euro/Mastercard, Maestro, and UnionPay. This ensures you have convenient and flexible payment options during your stay. If you have any questions about payment methods or need assistance, please feel free to ask our reception staff.</p>' },
  { title: 'Damage deposit', html: '<p>To ensure a safe and pleasant environment for all our guests, we have implemented the following damage deposit policy:</p><ul><li>A damage deposit of EUR 200 is required from all guests. This deposit serves as security against any damage caused to our property during your stay.</li><li>The deposit is fully refundable, provided no damage occurs and all house rules are respected.</li><li>In the event that guests break our house rules—such as smoking in the studios, playing loud music, hosting parties, issues that are disturbing other guests—a EUR 100 fine will be charged.</li><li>Guests will be held responsible for any damages caused and will be charged accordingly.</li></ul><p>Our damage policy affects only about 1% of our guests. However, by implementing this measure, we are protecting the other 99% who act responsibly and respectfully. We kindly ask for your understanding that this policy has been put in place for the safety and well-being of the vast majority of our guests.</p><p>We greatly appreciate your recognition and understanding that this policy exists not against, but for the benefit of the majority. This allows us to ensure a pleasant and secure environment for all guests who behave appropriately.</p>' },
  { title: 'Group policy', html: '<p>We do not accommodate stag or hen parties, or party guests in general and as such, group reservations for these events are not permitted.</p><h4>Group Bookings for Other Purposes</h4><p>If you are traveling as a group for sightseeing, a conference, or a seminar, we welcome your inquiry. Please provide the following details when contacting us:</p><ul><li>Desired check-in and check-out dates</li><li>Number of guests</li><li>Number of studios required</li><li>Purpose of your trip</li></ul><p>Please note: All group reservations are non-refundable. Please, send your inquiry to: <a href="mailto:amber.studios.budapest@gmail.com">amber.studios.budapest@gmail.com</a></p>' },
  { title: 'Family policy', html: '<p>We warmly welcome families with young children at our accommodation. For your convenience, we offer a complimentary cot or crib for children up to 2 years old. Additionally, children up to 6 years of age can stay free of charge when sharing the parents’ bed, making your family trip both easy and affordable. If you would like to request a cot or crib for your studio, please let us know in advance so we can have everything prepared for your arrival. We look forward to making your family’s stay as comfortable and enjoyable as possible.</p>' },
  { title: 'Pet policy', html: '<p>For the comfort and hygiene of all our guests, we do not allow animals on board. Thank you for your understanding.</p>' },
  { title: '(No) smoking', html: '<p>To ensure a safe and comfortable environment for all our guests, both Amber Gardenview Studios and Amber Terrace Studios maintain a strict non-smoking policy, which means all our studios are non-smoking. This policy is not only a house rule but also a legal requirement for accommodation providers in Budapest.</p><ul><li><strong>No Smoking:</strong> Smoking is strictly prohibited in all studio apartments and common areas throughout both properties.</li><li><strong>Legal Requirement:</strong> Compliance with this policy is mandated by local law.</li><li><strong>Smoke Detectors:</strong> Smoke detectors are installed throughout both properties to ensure guest safety and enforce this policy.</li><li><strong>Penalty for Violation:</strong> A €100 fine will be applied to any guest who violates the non-smoking rule.</li><li><strong>Guest Safety:</strong> These measures are in place to protect the well-being of all guests and to maintain the quality of our facilities.</li></ul><p>We kindly ask all guests to respect this policy for the safety and comfort of everyone. Thank you for your understanding and cooperation.</p><h4>Where is it allowed to smoke?</h4><p>We provide designated smoking areas at both of our properties for the comfort and convenience of all guests. At Amber Terrace Studios, the assigned smoking area is located in the courtyard, where you will find ashtrays and seating. At Amber Gardenview Studios, smoking is permitted in the garden area, and ashtrays are provided there as well.</p><p>If you are unable to locate the designated smoking areas, please consult with our reception staff for assistance. We kindly ask that you use only these areas for smoking and respect the presence of other guests by following our house rules. Smoking is always permitted on public streets outside the property. Thank you for your cooperation in maintaining a pleasant environment for everyone.</p>' },
  { title: 'Refunds & cancellations', html: '<h4>Flexible Rate (14 Days)</h4><ul><li>Cancel for free up to 14 days before your scheduled arrival.</li><li>After this period, a cancellation fee may apply.</li></ul><h4>Non-Refundable Rate</h4><ul><li>Receive a 10% discount at booking.</li><li>No refund is provided if you cancel at any time.</li></ul><h4>Long-Term Stays</h4><ul><li>Different cancellation policies apply based on the length of your stay.</li><li>Please contact us directly for details regarding long-term reservations.</li></ul><p>To cancel your reservation, simply contact our team or use the method provided in your booking confirmation. If you have questions about which policy applies to your booking, we’re happy to assist.</p>' },
  { title: 'Amber Studio rules', html: '<p>What are the house rules at Amber Studios Budapest? Here are the most important house rules, a complete list of our house rules are listed in the studios as it is required by law.</p><ul><li>Parties are not permitted.</li><li>Pets are not permitted onboard.</li><li>We do not accommodate stag or hen parties or any other party.</li><li>Loud music, smoking, drugs and excessive alcohol consumption are strictly prohibited.</li><li>Our property is not a hostel-style accommodation.</li><li>Quiet hours are observed from 22:00 to 7:00.</li><li>We are a strictly non-smoking accommodation that applies for both properties.</li><li>Any damages caused by guests during their stay will be billed directly to them.</li></ul><p>Thank you for helping us maintain a peaceful and comfortable environment for all guests.</p>' },
];

/* ---------- FAQ ---------- */
const FAQ = [
  { img: 'hall-entry', q: 'What are the reception opening hours at Amber Studios and where is it located?', a: '<p>Our reception is open daily from 9:00 AM to 7:00 PM, Monday through Sunday. While we do not offer 24-hour reception, you can reach us outside these hours via our AI BotChat system on WhatsApp for any assistance you may need.</p><p>Please note that we operate a single reception for both locations, which is located at Amber Gardenview Studios, Veres Pálné utca 26, 1053 Budapest. When you arrive, you’ll find our doorbell labeled "Amber Studios" to the right of the entrance. Our other location, Amber Terrace Studios, is located in Veres Pálné utca 7, 1053 Budapest, just 100 meters apart and managed through a single reception.</p>' },
  { img: 'entrance', q: 'When are check-in and check-out times?', a: '<p>Check-in begins at 3:00 PM at our reception, located at 26 Veres Pálné utca, 1053 Budapest at Amber Gardenview Studios. You can check in at reception between 3:00 PM and 6:30 PM for both Amber Gardenview Studios and Amber Terrace Studios.</p><p>If you plan to arrive after our reception hours, you will need to use our self-check-in service. Please email us your expected arrival time. If you are arriving outside of reception hours, we will provide you with detailed self-check-in instructions.</p><p>Please note that, in accordance with local regulations, all guests are required to upload their identification documents into our online registration system which is connected to the Hungarian VIZA system of the Ministry of Internal Affairs.</p><p>For guests with a reservation at Amber Terrace Studios (7 Veres Pálné utca), if you arrive after reception hours, you will check in directly at that location using our self-check-in process—there is no need to visit the reception at Amber Gardenview Studios.</p>' },
  { img: 'bike-storage', q: 'Early check-in (before 15h)', a: '<p>Our reception opens at 9:00 AM, and you are welcome to store your luggage in our dedicated luggage room located next to the reception at 26 Veres Pálné Street, where Amber Gardenview Studios are situated. If your studio becomes available before the standard 3:00 PM check-in time, we will be happy to notify you and offer early check-in. Please note that early check-in is subject to availability and can only be confirmed on the day of your arrival; we are unable to guarantee it in advance.</p>' },
  { img: 'staircase', q: 'Late check-in (after 19h)', a: '<p>If you arrive after 7 PM, self-check-in is required. Please inform us in advance if you will be arriving outside our reception hours. Your accommodation must be fully paid, and your documents uploaded to our online registration system, as required by law. Once your reservation is active and paid, you will have access to the registration portal. After completing registration, we will send you detailed self-check-in instructions, including how to retrieve your key from our keybox system and access your studio.</p><p>Please also note whether your accommodation is at Amber Gardenview Studios (Veres Pálné utca 26) or Amber Terrace Studios (Veres Pálné utca 7), as this is important for your arrival.</p>' },
  { img: 'svc-online', q: '24/7 Virtual reception', a: '<p>For your convenience, we provide an on-site reception located at Veres Pálné utca 26, on the ground floor of Amber Gardenview Studios. Our reception is open daily from 9:00 AM to 7:00 PM.</p><p>In addition, we offer a 24/7 online reception service, featuring a well-trained AI assistant ready to answer your questions and assist you with anything related to your stay at Amber Studios and your experience in Budapest.</p>' },
  { img: 'hall-mosaic', q: 'How do I check-out?', a: '<p>Check-out time at Amber Studios Budapest is by 10:00 AM. You can check out at our reception, where you’ll also find our luggage room for your convenience. Our reception is located at Amber Gardenview Studios in Veres Pálné utca 26. Alternatively, you can simply leave your studio and drop your key in one of the “AMBER KEYS” letter boxes, which are located in the common areas and near the entrance doors of both properties. This makes check-out quick and easy, whether you choose to visit reception or use the key drop boxes.</p>' },
  { img: 'lg-tr-2', q: 'Online registration and self-check-in (after 19:00 and optional)', a: '<p>We offer a fast and seamless check-in process through our online registration system, which you can complete before your arrival in Budapest. If you prefer, you may also proceed directly to your studio and check in independently, without visiting our reception.</p><p>For guests arriving after our on-site reception closes at 7:00 PM, we provide a convenient self check-in option. Using our online registration and secure keybox system, you will be able to access the key for your assigned studio and enter your accommodation at your arrival time.</p><p>This flexible approach ensures a smooth and hassle-free arrival, tailored to your travel schedule and preferences.</p>' },
  { img: 'svc-parking', q: 'Where can I park my car, motorcycle or bicycle?', a: '<p>You may securely store your bicycles in the inner courtyards of Amber Gardenview Studios or Amber Terrace Studios. It is not permitted to keep bicycles inside the studios.</p><p>Please be advised that parking in Budapest’s city center on public streets is chargeable, and certain areas are strictly reserved for permanent residents. To facilitate your parking needs, we recommend using the <a href="https://www.parkl.net/en/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">PARKL app</a>, available for download on both Google Play and the App Store.</p><p><strong>Secure your parking spot in advance:</strong> we encourage you to book a parking space in one of the underground garages close (5-8 min walking distance) to our property in advance through our trusted partner <a href="https://budapestcarpark.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">budapestcarpark.com</a>. Use our exclusive coupon code <strong>AMBER10</strong> to receive a 10% discount on your booking.</p><p><strong>Pollack Garage:</strong> a separate underground parking facility is available at <a href="http://pollackgarazs.hu/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Pollack Garage</a> on Pollack Mihály Square, approximately a 10-minute walk from the property. This garage, which is not included in the budapestcarpark.com reservation system, is the most economical option nearby. Address: 1080 Budapest, Pollack Mihály Square.</p>' },
  { img: 'sm-gv-4', q: 'How often do you clean the studio and change towels?', a: '<p>For a three-night stay, we provide one cleaning and towel change. For longer stays, cleaning and towel service are offered every third day. If you stay for seven nights, we will also change your bed linen once during your visit.</p>' },
  { img: 'md-tr-4', q: 'Can I bring the hotel towels to the public thermal baths?', a: '<p>It is strictly prohibited to remove towels from the accommodation. All towels provided are intended for use exclusively within your accommodation at Amber Studios. This policy helps us ensure proper hygiene, maintain the quality of our amenities, and provide all guests with clean towels throughout their stay. We kindly ask for your cooperation in respecting this rule. We can provide you with towels that are no longer in use or have minor damages with a limited amount.</p>' },
  { img: 'dining-coffee', q: 'Can I make my own coffee / tea during my stay?', a: '<p>Each studio is equipped with a kettle and complimentary coffee powder, available on your check-in day. You are welcome to prepare your own coffee at your convenience. If you prefer professionally brewed coffee or a wider selection of teas, we recommend several excellent breakfast and coffee places located nearby. We hope these options enhance your experience, whether you choose to enjoy a quiet cup in your room or explore the vibrant local café scene.</p>' },
  { img: 'dining-dish', q: 'Do you offer breakfast?', a: '<p>We do not offer breakfast on-site, but you’ll find a variety of highly rated breakfast spots just steps from our property—each one more delicious than the last. We love supporting our local community and encourage you to explore the fantastic breakfast options we recommend. Enjoy discovering your new favorite morning spot!</p>' },
  { img: 'lg-gv-3', q: 'Can I drink the tap water in Budapest?', a: '<p>Yes, you can safely drink the tap water in our studios. The water is clean, hygienic, and comes from the high-quality springs of Gellért Hill. Many guests enjoy its fresh taste. If you prefer bottled water, there are several food shops nearby where you can easily purchase it.</p>' },
  { img: 'courtyard-gv', q: 'What is the difference between Amber Gardenview Studios and Amber Terrace Studios?', a: '<p>Amber Studios operates two separate locations, each just 100 meters apart and managed through a single reception. Amber Gardenview Studios are situated at 26 Veres Pálné utca, where our reception is also located. Amber Terrace Studios can be found at 7 Veres Pálné utca, a short walk from the main building. Both properties offer Small, Medium, and Large Studios, all similarly equipped to ensure a comfortable stay. The main difference is their address and proximity to the reception; otherwise, guests can expect the same level of amenities and service at both locations.</p>' },
  { img: 'sm-tr-3', q: 'Air conditioning and heating', a: '<p>At Amber Studios Budapest, each studio apartment is equipped with air conditioning for the summer months and central heating during the winter, ensuring a comfortable stay year-round at both Amber Studios properties.</p>' },
  { img: 'facade', q: 'Is there an elevator in the building?', a: '<p>Amber Gardenview Studios in Veres Pálné utca 26, where our reception is conveniently located, does not have an elevator. All studios are situated on either the ground floor or the first floor and are accessible only by stairs. The staircase is wide and gently sloped, making it relatively easy to use.</p><p>Amber Terrace Studios, located in Veres Pálné utca 7, is equipped with an elevator for your comfort and convenience. Studios in this building are located on the first and second floors. Please be aware that the building also features a half floor (mezzanine), so your studio may be positioned on what is effectively the second or third floor. The elevator has a maximum capacity of 3 persons.</p><p>If you have any questions about accessibility or need assistance with your luggage, our staff will be happy to help.</p>' },
  { img: 'street-shops', q: 'Is there a luggage room available at Amber Studios?', a: '<p>We offer a complimentary luggage storage room for all Amber Studios guests, available daily from 9:00 AM to 6:30 PM. The luggage room is conveniently located next to our reception at Amber Gardenview Studios, 26 Veres Pálné Street.</p>' },
  { img: 'md-gv-2', q: 'Is it possible to rent a studio at Amber Studios for long stays? Do you offer long-term rentals?', a: '<p>For inquiries about extended stays, please email us at <a href="mailto:amber.studios.budapest@gmail.com">amber.studios.budapest@gmail.com</a> with your preferred dates, the number of guests, and your desired studio type. We will be happy to provide you with a tailored offer.</p>' },
  { img: 'bp-parliament', q: 'Tourist info and tickets', a: '<p>We recommend that our guests plan visits to various attractions in Budapest before their arrival and, if possible, purchase tickets online in advance. Some popular sights, such as tours of the Hungarian Parliament, often sell out during the high season. A must during your visit to Budapest is certainly a boat cruise on the Danube—especially those after sunset, as the city’s unique night-time illumination is a spectacle in itself. Visiting our thermal baths is also a true bathing experience, both in winter and summer.</p><p>We recommend Hop-On Hop-Off bus tickets as an excellent way to explore all of Budapest’s major attractions. Tickets for the Hungarian Parliament can be bought at <a href="https://www.parlament.hu/web/visitors/purchasing-tickets" target="_blank" rel="noopener">parlament.hu</a>.</p>' },
  { img: 'bp-danube', q: 'Where can I purchase tickets for the metro, bus and tram?', a: '<p>Budapest has an extensive, efficient, and affordable public transport system that includes metro lines, trams, buses, trolleybuses, suburban trains (HÉV), and even public boat services on the Danube.</p><p>Tickets/passes can be purchased at metro stations, vending machines, newsstands, and via the <a href="https://bkk.hu/en/tickets-and-passes/budapestgo/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">BudapestGO app</a>. For comprehensive information about Budapest’s public transportation, with details on routes, tickets, airport transfers, and travel planning please check <a href="https://bkk.hu/en/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">bkk.hu</a>.</p>' },
  { img: 'bp-vaci', q: 'Tips for your security', a: '<ul><li>Avoid exchanging money at the airport, as rates are typically less favorable. Always check the current exchange rate on the <a href="https://www.mnb.hu/en/arfolyamok" target="_blank" rel="noopener">official National Bank of Hungary website</a>.</li><li>Be cautious of tourist traps in the city center, particularly on Váci utca. Always review recent comments about any venue you plan to visit on Google Maps.</li><li>In restaurants, double-check your invoice to see whether the service charge (szervízdíj) is included—each establishment handles this differently.</li><li>For your safety and to avoid being overcharged, we recommend using taxis that offer online booking and payment options. Be cautious when hailing taxis directly from the street, as some may charge significantly higher fares or use unreliable pricing.</li></ul>' },
  { img: 'lg-gv-2', q: 'Is Amber Studios the right choice for guests traveling with children?', a: '<p>We warmly welcome families with young children at our accommodation. For your convenience, we offer a complimentary cot or crib for children up to 2 years old. Additionally, children up to 6 years of age can stay free of charge when sharing the parents’ bed, making your family trip both easy and affordable. Children and infants can be accommodated in Medium and Large Studios, but not in Small Studios.</p><p>If you would like to request a cot or crib for your studio, please let us know in advance so we can have everything prepared for your arrival.</p>' },
  { img: 'courtyard-garden', q: 'Does Amber Studios accommodate pets in the studio apartment?', a: '<p>For the comfort and hygiene of all our guests, we do not allow animals on board. Thank you for your understanding.</p>' },
  { img: 'svc-laundry', q: 'Do you offer laundry and ironing services?', a: '<p>At Amber Studios Budapest, guests have access to a washing machine and drying rack, with complimentary washing powder provided for your convenience. This self-service laundry facility is available for a fee of €5 per use, payable by credit card. The washing machine is located at our reception at Veres Pálné utca 26, within Amber Gardenview Studios.</p><p>For your ironing needs, an iron and ironing board are available upon request at our reception. If you prefer, we can also recommend several nearby professional laundry services—please feel free to ask our team or consult our AI ChatBot for details.</p>' },
  { img: 'street-cars', q: 'Are there reputable car rental companies in Budapest?', a: '<p>If you\'re looking to rent a car in Hungary, you\'ll find many options online. For convenience and reliability, we recommend choosing an internationally recognized company within walking distance. One excellent choice is <a href="https://www.sixt.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Sixt</a>, which has a downtown pickup and dropoff location at the Kempinski Hotel Corvinus in downtown Budapest (Erzsébet tér 7-8., 1051 Budapest).</p><p>From Amber Studios, it\'s a 13-minute walk to the Kempinski Hotel, or you can take Metro Line 3 (The Blue Line) one stop to Deák Ferenc Square, right next to the hotel.</p>' },
];

