const SERVICES = [
  { id: 'transfer', img: 'svc-transfer', icon: 'car', name: 'Airport transfer & taxi service', short: 'Book your transfer with Welcome Pickups', html: '<p>We have partnered with Welcome Pickups for safe and reliable transfers. You can arrange, modify, and pay for your ride with ease—all bookings, cancellations, and payments are managed securely with this trusted service.</p><p><strong>How it works:</strong> the price for your transfer will be displayed after you enter your details. You can book transfers to and from the airport, as well as to any other destination within or outside Budapest. For your convenience, you may also use this taxi service for other trips anywhere in or outside Budapest.</p>', cta: { label: 'Book a transfer', href: TRANSFER } },
  { id: 'laundry', img: 'svc-laundry', icon: 'laundry', name: 'Laundry', short: 'EUR 5 per wash, next to the reception', html: '<p>For your convenience, we offer a straightforward laundry service. For just EUR 5, you can use our washing machine, located next to the reception. Washing powder and a drying rack are provided. If you require an iron and ironing board, please let us know and we will be happy to assist you.</p>' },
  { id: 'bikes', img: 'svc-bike', icon: 'bike', name: 'Bike and e-scooter rental', short: 'Rental shops on the same street', html: '<p>Budapest features an extensive network of bike paths, making it an increasingly popular and convenient city to explore by bicycle. Whether you prefer traditional city bikes or e-bikes, there are several options near Amber Studios.</p><p><strong>Our recommendations:</strong> we suggest the following bike rental shops located very close to our accommodation: <a href="https://www.ibikebudapest.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">iBikeBudapest</a> and <a href="https://emaginetours.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">E-magine rides Budapest</a>.</p>' },
  { id: 'tickets', img: 'bp-parliament-2', icon: 'ticket', name: 'Tourist info and tickets', short: 'Plan ahead and book online', html: '<p>We recommend that our guests plan visits to various attractions in Budapest before their arrival and, if possible, purchase tickets online in advance. Some popular sights, such as tours of the Hungarian Parliament, often sell out during the high season. A must during your visit to Budapest is certainly a boat cruise on the Danube—especially those after sunset, as the city’s unique night-time illumination is a spectacle in itself. Visiting our thermal baths is also a true bathing experience, both in winter and summer. Many of the most popular baths among tourists offer outdoor pools with cold water in the summer.</p><ul><li>We recommend Hop-On Hop-Off bus tickets as an excellent way to explore all of Budapest’s major attractions at your own pace.</li><li>Tickets for the <a href="https://www.parlament.hu/web/visitors/purchasing-tickets" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Hungarian Parliament</a>.</li><li>Tickets for cruises, thermal baths, folklore concerts and dance performances, Jewish heritage tours, classical concerts and more.</li></ul>' },
  { id: 'parking', img: 'svc-parking', icon: 'parking', name: 'Parking nearby', short: 'Underground garages 5–8 minutes away', html: '<p>Please be advised that parking in Budapest’s city center on public streets is chargeable, and certain areas are strictly reserved for permanent residents. To facilitate your parking needs, we recommend using the <a href="https://www.parkl.net/en/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">PARKL app</a>, available for download on both Google Play and the App Store.</p><p><strong>Secure your parking spot in advance:</strong> we encourage you to book a parking space in one of these underground garages close (5-8 min walking distance) to our property in advance through our trusted partner. Use our exclusive coupon code <strong>AMBER10</strong> to receive a 10% discount on your booking at <a href="https://budapestcarpark.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Parking Budapest</a>.</p><p><strong>Pollack Garage:</strong> a separate underground parking facility is available at <a href="http://pollackgarazs.hu/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Pollack Garage</a> on Pollack Mihály Square, approximately a 10-minute walk from the property. This garage, which is not included in the budapestcarpark.com reservation system, is the most economical option nearby. Address: 1080 Budapest, Pollack Mihály Square.</p>', cta: { label: 'Book parking', href: 'https://budapestcarpark.com' } },
  { id: 'reception', img: 'svc-online', icon: 'headset', name: '24/7 online reception · AI bot', short: 'On-site 9:00–19:00, online around the clock', html: '<p>For your convenience, we provide an on-site reception located at Veres Pálné utca 26, on the ground floor of Amber Gardenview Studios. Our reception is open daily from 9:00 AM to 7:00 PM.</p><p>In addition, we offer a 24/7 online reception service, featuring a well-trained AI assistant ready to answer your questions and assist you with anything related to your stay at Amber Studios and your experience in Budapest.</p>', cta: { label: 'Chat on WhatsApp', href: WHATSAPP } },
];

